WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:36.083
In the first two verses of Chapter 15,

2
00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.666
Lord Krishna showed this world as a vast,

3
00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:41.666
complex Ashwattha tree –

4
00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:45.583
with roots above and branches spreading below.

5
00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:48.541
This comparison shows that the world

6
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:50.583
is only a reflection

7
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.083
of spiritual truth.

8
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:54.375
He explained

9
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.416
that this tree

10
00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:58.625
is nourished by the gunas, and
keeps the jivatma

11
00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.625
entangled in its branches and roots.

12
00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.416
Now Lord Krishna explains

13
00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:06.083
why this tree

14
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:07.708
is so difficult to understand –

15
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:11.458
and what the way out of it is.

16
00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.000
In this verse, Lord Krishna

17
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.125
gives us

18
00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:21.375
a very practical and eye-opening

19
00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:23.125
teaching –

20
00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.666
do not waste time trying to fully
understand the world.

21
00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:30.416
Instead, find the means to get out of it.

22
00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:34.083
This world, like the Ashwattha tree, can never

23
00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:36.583
be fully understood from within.

24
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:38.166
Where it begins,

25
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:39.166
where it ends,

26
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.791
and what it rests upon –

27
00:01:40.791 --> 00:01:43.125
none of this is visible to us.

28
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.916
Just as Arjun, upon seeing

29
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:48.125
the Vishwaroop, said he could not see

30
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:51.083
its beginning, middle, or end –

31
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:53.625
the situation here is the same.

32
00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:57.416
This confusion reflects the truth of our own lives.

33
00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:00.250
We keep debating philosophically –

34
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:04.041
is the world real or unreal, eternal

35
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:05.125
or not.

36
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.416
But Lord Krishna says –

37
00:02:07.416 --> 00:02:10.291
the purpose is not to solve this puzzle,

38
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:13.708
but to be freed from this bondage.

39
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:15.958
And how will this freedom come?

40
00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:19.000
Not through analysis, but through action.

41
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.750
This deeply-rooted tree

42
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:24.333
must be cut down with the axe
of vairagya or asanga –

43
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:28.916
Asanga means detachment from
sense-objects and attachments.

44
00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:32.875
And it must be cut with dridh nishchay –
dridhena chhittva.

45
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:36.083
that is - cut it with unwavering resolve.

46
00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:38.875
Our attachments are very deep –

47
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:40.583
su-virudha-mulam –

48
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:41.416
because

49
00:02:41.416 --> 00:02:42.333
for many lifetimes

50
00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:43.750
we have clung to fleeting pleasures,

51
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.583
roles, and identities.

52
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:49.583
So detachment does not come in a day.

53
00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:50.833
But through continuous

54
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:52.250
practice and good company,

55
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.833
these roots begin to loosen.

56
00:02:54.833 --> 00:02:56.333
Slowly,

57
00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:59.958
every effort moves us toward liberation.

58
00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:01.666
In this verse, Lord Krishna

59
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:03.958
gives us this message –

60
00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:06.958
do not remain entangled in
the world’s complexities.

61
00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:10.583
Instead, take the clear path to liberation.

62
00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:12.208
End your attachments

63
00:03:12.208 --> 00:03:15.541
and prepare for the next step –

64
00:03:15.541 --> 00:03:17.666
the search for truth.

65
00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:24.375
Sometimes you think –

66
00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:26.416
‘Why did this happen to me?

67
00:03:26.416 --> 00:03:28.875
Why did they not understand me?

68
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:31.583
Why did life take this turn?’

69
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:34.208
Understand this –

70
00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:38.083
the beginning, end, and workings of this world

71
00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:41.666
are like the inverted Ashwattha tree –

72
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:45.458
unclear, shifting,

73
00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.875
and illusory.

74
00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:50.583
Trying to untangle every branch

75
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:53.000
will only exhaust you.

76
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.750
True peace

77
00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.916
does not come from finding an
answer to every confusion.

78
00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:00.291
It comes

79
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:04.208
when you let go of control over events

80
00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:06.500
and focus on

81
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.958
what truly matters.

82
00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:12.250
This is why I said –

83
00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.666
‘Do not try

84
00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:17.333
to fully understand this tree.

85
00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:22.833
Cut it down with the axe of vairagya.’

86
00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:24.375
You do not need to know

87
00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:27.625
every complexity of the past.

88
00:04:27.625 --> 00:04:31.750
Simply move forward with clarity in the present.

89
00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.000
Slowly

90
00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.416
but firmly, let go of the entanglements.

91
00:04:36.416 --> 00:04:38.833
What you are searching for

92
00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:44.375
is not in the confusion – it is in freedom.

93
00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:45.375
Reflect on this.

94
00:04:50.208 --> 00:04:53.125
In families, it often feels as though

95
00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:57.458
you must explain the reason for every decision,

96
00:04:57.458 --> 00:05:01.000
give an argument for every point.

97
00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.208
But sometimes, to help

98
00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:07.541
or protect, what is needed is not words

99
00:05:07.541 --> 00:05:13.166
but stillness and firm action.

100
00:05:13.166 --> 00:05:18.500
Like the roots of this Ashwattha tree – 
finding their beginning

101
00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.500
and end is difficult, but

102
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:25.083
cutting them is necessary.

103
00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:27.583
In homes there are often heavy habits,

104
00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:30.500
ways of working, or behaviours

105
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.916
that have been carried on for years.

106
00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:35.791
In such situations,

107
00:05:35.791 --> 00:05:40.166
there is no need to keep wondering
why and how they have continued. 

108
00:05:40.166 --> 00:05:44.666
Simply stop feeding them.

109
00:05:44.666 --> 00:05:49.458
Take one step back. Say a clear ‘no.’

110
00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:52.875
Build your safe boundary.

111
00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:56.541
Not to punish anyone –

112
00:05:56.541 --> 00:06:00.416
but to protect the love within.

113
00:06:00.416 --> 00:06:05.166
Sometimes the most righteous
action done in silence

114
00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:09.250
is the greatest service to the family.

115
00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:11.583
So I say –

116
00:06:11.583 --> 00:06:13.583
cut the root,

117
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.875
even if others cannot see it.

118
00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:21.291
When right action is done with stillness,

119
00:06:21.291 --> 00:06:24.291
silence becomes more meaningful

120
00:06:24.291 --> 00:06:26.041
than words.

121
00:06:26.041 --> 00:06:28.958
This is true service to the family.

122
00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:32.083
When you rise above argument

123
00:06:32.083 --> 00:06:35.708
and act rightly in silence,

124
00:06:35.708 --> 00:06:40.500
you lead the whole family toward
the path of resolution –

125
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.458
toward Me.

126
00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:51.708
At the workplace it is often said –

127
00:06:51.708 --> 00:06:54.583
‘Be passionate about your work,

128
00:06:54.583 --> 00:06:58.166
give it everything you have.’

129
00:06:58.166 --> 00:07:01.375
But remember – true leadership

130
00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:05.125
comes not from attachment, but from clarity.

131
00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:07.250
Let Me explain –

132
00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.916
asanga that is - detachment -

133
00:07:10.916 --> 00:07:13.166
not indifference.

134
00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:15.333
It is your strength.

135
00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:18.666
Work with your whole heart,

136
00:07:18.666 --> 00:07:23.666
but do not be bound by results and positions –

137
00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:27.125
only then does your leadership
become unshakeable.

138
00:07:27.125 --> 00:07:31.083
Roles, targets, deadlines –

139
00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:33.750
these are all like the branches

140
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:37.041
of that inverted Ashwattha tree.

141
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.333
It is not necessary to understand
every complexity.

142
00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:44.083
What is needed is clarity of thought –

143
00:07:44.083 --> 00:07:47.625
the ability to cut yourself free from the noise of

144
00:07:47.625 --> 00:07:49.958
ego, recognition, and success.

145
00:07:49.958 --> 00:07:55.833
This clarity comes only when
you do not get bound.

146
00:07:55.833 --> 00:08:00.083
Asanga keeps you steady under pressure,

147
00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:02.708
gives you the strength to make right decisions,

148
00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:06.083
and gives your team confidence.

149
00:08:06.083 --> 00:08:10.208
So do not only climb the ladder of position –

150
00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:12.208
also rise

151
00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:16.833
above attachment and entanglement.

152
00:08:16.833 --> 00:08:20.375
Asanga does not weaken your leadership –

153
00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:23.208
it makes it invincible.

154
00:08:23.208 --> 00:08:27.125
And if you are an employee, remember –

155
00:08:27.125 --> 00:08:29.000
your worth

156
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.833
lies not only in meeting targets,

157
00:08:31.833 --> 00:08:34.208
but in

158
00:08:34.208 --> 00:08:35.375
how much

159
00:08:35.375 --> 00:08:39.083
sincerity and balance you bring to your work.
